1. Visible Footer Credit on Every Page
You must display the exact text "Website Design & Code by Aarham" at the
bottom footer of EVERY page of the website. It must link directly to the
dedicated developer credit page (credits.html) described in Rule 3.

2. Minimum Size & Readability (No Hiding)
The footer credit must be clearly visible to all visitors. It must use a font
size of at least 16px (or larger than standard body text), use high-contrast
colors, and must NOT be hidden, transparent, or collapsed.

3. Mandatory Dedicated Developer Page (credits.html)
You must keep and include an intact, publicly accessible page named
"credits.html" (or "/credits") linked from every page footer. This page must
clearly display the original creator's information without edits:
- Creator Name: Aarham
- GitHub Profile: Aarham-Super /Github.com/Aarham-Super
- Official Website: no website yet
- Bio/Role: Web Developer & Designer

4. No Minor-Edit Loopholes
Changing a few words in the HTML, renaming CSS classes, or slightly changing
colors does not remove the requirement to follow Rules 1, 2, and 3.

5. Automatic Termination
If you remove, alter, shrink, or hide the footer link or the credits.html page,
your permission to use this code ends immediately, making your website an
unauthorized copyright infringement subject to takedown.
